msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_false_love_return/0/g-0/c-4/10
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Leaving? Why... I have some..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_false_love_return/0/g-0/c-4/18
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Unfurnished Business of my own to take care of..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_false_love_return/0/g-0/c-4/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you still need to do?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_false_love_return/0/g-0/c-4/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "A lady never tells..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_false_love_return/0/g-0/c-5/7 scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_top/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Ha! Let us see what the glass will magnify!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Ah yes, I have done it!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/12
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Well done Jonathan you cad."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Am I barging in on something again?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Jonathan?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh, it's you!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "My 'friend'!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "We are friends."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Very good friends I might add."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's with the mystery?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You sound insane."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I am a master of relationships, you see. But even a master needs his tools."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I have procured one 'date-a-dex' for mineself, and egad the functionality is fecund!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I have you in here, see for yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "So much more to go, but I quite love filling in all the little bubbles and baubles!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Now that we are friends indeed, you must must show me yours, since I showed you mine."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/g-1/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay, sounds fun!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/g-1/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, please don't do that."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/shonuff/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "What! I thought... well yes it says right here!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/shonuff/12
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "FRIENDS!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/shonuff/20
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Is that... simply not true?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/shonuff/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not true. I'm not comfortable with this."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/shonuff/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My mistake, here is my date-a-dex."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/shonuff/c-6/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Then I am no longer comfortable with you!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/shonuff/c-6/18
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I am stricken! From engaging in delightful little clandestine candelabra capers, to denying me a chance to even peek at your history!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/shonuff/c-6/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's over, Scandalabra."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/shonuff/c-6/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fine. Here's my dex."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/shonuff/c-6/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "And yet, that's one scandal, right? One more scandal to throw on my flames?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/shonuff/c-6/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I knew you were still a good egg!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/shonuff/c-6/26/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ah you got me, here you go."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/shonuff/c-6/26/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return/0/shonuff/c-6/26/c-0/23/c-1/45
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Never show a dude your dex like that. Trust me."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Scandalabra stands rakishly with his eyes hungrily searching for a scandal of yours to pique his interest."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/14
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You may not have cut me to the wick just yet..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/22
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But since you have been away, I wonder if the human has done more play..."
msgstr ""

