msgid "Actually, I'm here because Maggie has some questions for you."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Well that's no fun!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You don't want to... go through all the scandals you've caused?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm tired of it."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-2/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm never going to make enough lovers to truly scandalize you."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-2/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm bored and want you to fall in love with me already."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Tired... of scandals??"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-2/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Giving up on love... forever?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-2/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Bored of me... and yet..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-2/15/c-2/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Undeniably and irresistibly drawn to my love?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-2/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "<w>HOW SCANDALOUS!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-3/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/c-4/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/c-3/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_success/0/c-4/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_nokiss/0/c-2/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_2/0/g-0/c-5/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_3_nokiss/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh... really? Hm."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-3/18
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Maybe... this waits... until the list is complete?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-3/26 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/c-4/26 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/c-3/26 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_success/0/c-4/26 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_nokiss/0/c-2/26 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_2/0/g-0/c-5/26 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_3_nokiss/0/c-2/26
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "That is... if my potential love is important to you..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-3/34/0/s/0 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/c-4/34/0/s/0 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/c-3/34/0/s/0 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_success/0/c-4/34/0/s/0 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_nokiss/0/c-2/34/0/s/0 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_2/0/g-0/c-5/34/0/s/0 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_3_nokiss/0/c-2/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It is important to me... I'll let this Maggie thing go for now and return with more lovers for you to be scandalized about."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-3/34/1/s/0 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/c-4/34/1/s/0 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/c-3/34/1/s/0 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_success/0/c-4/34/1/s/0 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_nokiss/0/c-2/34/1/s/0 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_2/0/g-0/c-5/34/1/s/0 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_3_nokiss/0/c-2/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Now I'm suspicious."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-3/34/c-0/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/c-4/34/c-0/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/c-3/34/c-0/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_success/0/c-4/34/c-0/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_nokiss/0/c-2/34/c-0/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_2/0/g-0/c-5/34/c-0/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_3_nokiss/0/c-2/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Do. Please."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_friend_return_2/0/c-3/34/c-1/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/c-4/34/c-1/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/c-3/34/c-1/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_success/0/c-4/34/c-1/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_nokiss/0/c-2/34/c-1/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_2/0/g-0/c-5/34/c-1/7 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_3_nokiss/0/c-2/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "All right. So be it!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh heavens no. We are through, yourself and mineself."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_hate_return/0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You positively REEK of scandal. And I will find out about it in mine own ways. Without you."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_hate_return/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bye..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_hate_return/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm here because Maggie has some questions for you."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_hate_return/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've got this candy, so gimme a chance, Scandy. (USE SASS CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_hate_return/0/c-0/7 scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Good bye!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_hate_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Ha! Bring her in."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_hate_return/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Ah ha."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_hate_return/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Aha ha ha ha ha ha."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_hate_return/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Fine."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_hate_return/0/c-2/31
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Ta for now."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/25
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Well, well, well! It seems I am in high demand!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/33
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "That's one way of putting it..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Enough chit chat! Word on the street is, you've been calling someone in this house counterfeit!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Me?! Whyever would I make such an allegacious allegation?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We know it was you. We have evidence!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We have a witness that points to you."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I challenge you to produce it!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I challenge you to produce them!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You asked for it. Stepford!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/11
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Hi Scandalabra."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Scandalabra's face falls."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/27
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh, drat."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/38
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Remember last week, when you told me:"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/46
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "'The silverware is fake. It's not real silver. It's counterfeit?'"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/54
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I have a faint recollection of such an occurence."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/62
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I remember it clear as day! You started the rumor, not me."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/73/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Answer this allegation!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/73/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What have you got to say for yourself?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/73/g-0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Yes, well, I was merely... Merely causing a stir!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/73/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can't do that! It's not cool to spread rumors, especially about others."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/73/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whether you were just having fun or not, this rumor ends now."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/73/g-0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh, candlesticks. You're such a spoilsport."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/73/g-0/8/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "The real question is why? Why the rumor?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/73/g-0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh really? What are you going to do? Debunk it?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/73/g-0/8/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's precisely what we're going to do."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/73/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Precisely!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/73/g-0/8/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But first, why? Why the rumor?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/74/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pretty sure allegacious isn't a real word. Also, the 'why' is pretty obvious. You're a fiend for drama."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Not so fast... There may be something underneath all of this."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_questions/0/c-0/15/g-0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that true? What was the reason you started all of this, Scandalabra?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Why, you ask? Why?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Scandalabra loses control, looking rather like a harried murderer at the witness stand."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Because it's true! That's why!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/24
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I've seen the silverware flaunting his 'authenticity' left and right, and I simply had to put an end to it."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/35
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "When you've got real pedigree like I do, you can't bear to see others pretend they've got the same class!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/43
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Quite a bold claim, Scandalabra. Can you back it up?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/51
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Why, certainly!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why not give us your evidence, then?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Alright, I will!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "First and foremost, true silver like me shines brilliantly."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Have a look, and see for yourself. I'm dazzling."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The silverware in the drawer is dull and even has some streaks on it."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Second rate, obviously."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What else?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Second, there's no need to mark real silver. It's enough on its own, and needs no stamp of approval. The silver in the drawer is all covered with stamps."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/47/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you say. Anything more?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/47/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Why, simply listen to the way I speak? Can you question for a moment that such a delicious degree of diction could be achieved by anything less than a genuine article?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/47/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that all?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/47/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I also pinky promise that it's true alright no need for further questioning!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/47/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Case closed!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/47/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Ok, now it's personal."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/47/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Nobody closes my cases for me!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/47/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/42
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Uh oh..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit3/0/c-0/47/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/53/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Easy Maggie. Let's break all this down with a level head."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Indeed. Let's separate fact from fiction and flush out the fraud!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Where should we start?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about the issue of shininess?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about the Scandalabra's pinky promise? That sounds pretty legit."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about the way Scandalabra speaks?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright. I think I've heard enough..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/11
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "What's your opinion?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Real silver shouldn't look dirty like that."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Doesn't silver tarnish?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You tell me!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Not unless it is!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "The silverware has got a bit of tarnish from... well... your neglect."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Heheh... oops."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Riiiight."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/c-0/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Got you there, Scandalabra!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/c-0/23/g-0/8 scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Drat!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Precisely correct!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/c-1/18
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Real silver must be polished to bring it back up to its highest lustre."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Scandalabra's got it completely wrong."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/c-2/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Real silver tarnishes, and must be polished to bring it back up to its highest lustre."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Scandalabra hasn't been polished in months, and he's gleaming like a chrome-plated fender."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "The silverware, on the other hand, has got a bit of tarnish from... well... your neglect."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-0/19/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oops. But good point! Seems like we've got you there, Scandalabra."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-1/11
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Naturally, I shall not dignify that as evidence of anything except idiocy."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-2/11
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "What about it?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-2/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He did take pains to point out his delicious degree of dictition."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-2/19/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think pedantic palaver points to pedigree."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-2/19/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Him talk funny."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-2/19/c-0/7 scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-2/19/c-1/7 scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-2/19/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "While articulation and eloquence are praised by the prestigious, they are not foolproof signs of anything."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-2/19/c-0/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And I must point out that 'dictition' is not a real word..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-2/19/c-0/23 scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-2/19/c-1/15 scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-2/19/c-2/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "...and only a pathological prat like the Scandalabra would use it to cast blame on the innocent!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit4/0/17/5/c-3/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Not so fast! You're forgetting one last thing..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/4/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Quite so! The engraving of approval!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/5/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Quite so! The supposed stamp!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/6/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Idk I'm bad at this."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "REAL silver is stamped in order to affirm its authenticity!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "If we look on YOUR bottom, however, Scandalabra, I suspect we shall find something OTHER than such a stamp!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh no! Not my..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Maggie slips around the Scandalabra, grasping his coat in one hand and lifting it to inspect his posterior."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-0/38
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Aha! There we have it!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-0/46
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Not a stamp of sincerity, but the note of a knockoff!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-0/57
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh the shame!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-0/65/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Got you! Now, you'd better go explain yourself to everyone you spread that rumor to!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-0/66/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Scoundrel! Time to fess up!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And then you can go apologize to the silverware for having besmirched his reputation with your own lies!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As punishment, you can go ahead and give it a good polish while you're at it!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As punishment, you can paste that sticker on your forehead!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-1/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I believe that punishment has no place in an enlightened society, and that virtues should be held in a higher regard instead."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-1/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Idk I'm just along for the ride."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Scandalabra's expression goes entirely blank."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Alright. I know when I've lost."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I'm not really a so-called Scandalabra."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I'm a completely ordinary cheaply-made knockoff from Freehold, New Jersey."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/35
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I just want to be special, y'know?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/43
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "When you're mass-produced, you just get that urge to strike out on your own."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/51/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Rebel knows how it is."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/51/b/12
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Shut up, cuck."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/51/b/29
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/54
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I had left the factory learning that I was essentially a defect from the start."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/62
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "A bum."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/70
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "But there was no need to lash out at the rest of us."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/78
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You're right, Maggie!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/89
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You're always right Maggie."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/97
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I've tried to dig dirt up on you but you're squeaky clean."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/105
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "And for all my digging, all my messing around, I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/113
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I still... kinda get off on learning about all the relations around the house, though?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/121
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He pokes the tips of his index fingers together in a gesture that reminds you of the way he used to present to you."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/129
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "If it's okay with you... I'll just watch and enjoy."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/137
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "From here."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/145
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Er... as long as no one is getting hurt."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/153
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "And you promise to tell no more tales."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/161
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You have my word."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/169
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well then I'll call this case closed."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/180
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Stay out of trouble, uh..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/188
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "What is your real name?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/196
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh just a completely ordinary candle-kinda name."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/204
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Jon Wick."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/215
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "An utterly ordinary name destined for mediocrity, you're quite certain."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/220
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well Mr. Wick. Stay out of trouble."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/231/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maggie, we did it!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/231/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What a blast!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/231/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Case closed!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/231/c-11/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Cheeky!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-2/231/c-11/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I guess in THIS case, I'll allow another to shut the door!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/3
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You were wonderful!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "YOU were wonderful! I can't wait to work on another mystery with you again."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't tell if I'm just swept up in the moment, but... I'd really like to kiss you right now."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know Maggie, I'm having second thoughts about saying we should just be friends."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/c-12/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "As a friend, or...?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/c-12/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, as a friend!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/c-12/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No. Something more than that."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/c-12/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Sounds good! See you on the next one."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/c-12/15/c-0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Maggie leaves you, seemingly unwilling to resolve your relationship in the presence of the disgraced candelabra."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/c-12/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "You've just made me so happy. I can't wait to see you again! Goodbye for now... lover."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/c-12/15/c-1/25 scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/c-14/28
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Maggie leaves you, seemingly unwilling to formally resolve your relationship in the presence of the disgraced candelabra."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I thought you'd never say that! Come here!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/c-13/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Maggie curls her arms around you, planting a kiss on you so sizzling it would make even Scandalabra blush."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/c-13/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe we can go find somewhere to be alone, and... um... celebrate."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/c-13/29/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's just try that again... and again... and again..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/c-13/29/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Follow me..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/CaseoftheCounterfeit5/0/g-4/c-14/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I would love that. Let's meet again soon... for a date."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "An 18th-century dandy strikes a dramatic pose before you, turning this way and that as though modeling in his own imaginary spotlight."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He seems <i>quite</i> impressed with himself."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/19
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Yes! Yes! It's me! It's me!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/30
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The one, the only..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/38
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "<w>Scandalabra!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Get bent you lump of waxy buildup."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's special about you?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I'm the one, the only!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Do you see any other candelabra here?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just because you're singular doesn't mean anything. There's one piano, too."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I have several candelabras in the attic."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Ah yes, Keyes..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/c-1/23/c-0/18
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Sadly she seems to be scandal-proof that one."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Nay! Perish the thought! Had you any surely I would know of it!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/c-1/23/g-0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "My little wicks would have made certain of it."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/intro_scandalabra/0/c-1/23/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Little wicks?"
msgstr ""

