#: scandalabra_candelabra/lexicon_time/0/g-0/c-4/9/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The mad hunter stalks their prey, and chooses the most beautiful yet most immobile of them all."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/lexicon_time/0/g-0/c-4/12
