#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who cares?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually they are back together again, thanks to my help."
