#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I did know that actually."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The world entire cares!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh! Then my information is faulty... But thank you for the update. My esteem of you <w>rises!</w>"
