#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Such a thing is not imaginable. But in one that I've seen, they've hidden themselves within THEIR VERY NAMES."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-2/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's too tough to follow."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-2/39/s/0 scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-3/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that really a scandal?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-2/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The devs? Met them."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-2/c-12/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh yes indeed. Critics HATE that sort of self-referential garbage."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-2/c-13/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You've MET this lot?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-2/c-13/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I didn't think such a thing possible."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-2/c-13/23
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "<w>ESTEEM!!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Very well. One last scandal. There's no possibility you've heard of it."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Long ago, a relic was stolen from an island nation, brought to these shores, and hidden underneath this house in a box."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Surely you haven't heard this yet?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-3/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, you're right. I didn't know that!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-3/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know it to be true, because I have found her!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-3/c-15/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Yes it is! Stolen, secreted away, and underneath these floorboards!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-3/c-15/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "At the very least it is INTERESTING."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-3/c-16/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I CANNOT BELIEVE THIS."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-3/c-16/21
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You did all that... before even talking to me ONCE."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-3/c-16/29
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I'm the candelabra placed obviously and magnificently in the dining room. You weren't even curious passing by??"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-3/c-16/37
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "My esteem does not like this."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "No matter."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "That is more scandal than your puny pate can handal."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-4/16/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Until we meet again, magnificent little scandal-monger."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/goings_on/0/g-4/17/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I will teach you the ways of the scandal-monger soon enow."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You come upon the Scandalabra with his back to you, talking to himself while seeming to furiously polish... something."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/14
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "One part calcium... two parts carbonate..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/19
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Polish until glistening..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/27
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Yes... smoother... smoother!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/35
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Take out those sullied smears..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/43
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Effulge... Effulge!!!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/51
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oooooh!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/62
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He sets the cloth down on the table, delicately wiping his brow before finally turning."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/75
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Damnation."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/83
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "DO YOU EVEN KNOCK HUMAN?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/97/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're sitting on the table, what else am I supposed to do."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/98/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Keep going..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/99/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maggie has a few questions for you..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "That silly little sleuth? Not now... not now..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh, how dare you."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The polishing of my knop is a sacred art."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Only the most panegyrical of acolytes are allowed to know of my backstairs ministrations."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "And you... are not that."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I know not what you are. My inquests have turned up fallow."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Well you've come to see me, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-0/51
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Must be for my brilliant shine."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-0/59
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "<w>WHICH IS WHAT I WAS DOING.</w>"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-0/73/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure you were."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-0/74/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't see anything, I swear!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I am made of the purest silver. Born in a small chandler's hut in the Swiss village of Saint-Martin, I have traveled transatlantically to this abode, where I preside over the rest of the objets."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I require a great deal of polishing and care. Which YOU do not do."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "So I am forced to self-lubricate."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I picked you up at a Valdivimart in the bargain bin?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What makes you think you're in charge of the rest of the objects around here?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry I don't polish you. You deserve better."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Hmph. Yes that is where I ended up after a long and torrid affair with a bellicose baroness in Belgium."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "She had unceremoniously dumped me in an antiques shop in Lisbon - where I sailed along with a smuggler across the ocean."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-5/23
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Your new country fascinated me at first, until the veneer of novelty abraded."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-5/31
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I had lived with one of your landed gentry until they perished as your kind do."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-5/39
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The ruffians who exhumed his palace threw me in a sort of refuse bin, where I ended up as a 'bargain'."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-5/47
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But I am no bargain."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Why I am better, older, wiser, and purer than they."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Tell me, do you see any alloys around here?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-6/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-6/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I guess there are some."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-6/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Alloys! IMPURE metals!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-6/23/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess the washing machine?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-6/23/c-0/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe a lamp?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-6/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "There are COUNTLESS IMPURE ALLOYS here."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-6/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Why in your modern day, there is almost nothing that is one element."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-6/23/c-1/23 scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I am Argentum! All my atoms are singular, rigid, upright, of good stock!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-6/23/c-1/31 scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "One of the ancient metals - friend of humans since time immemorial."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "And most importantly. I am chaste."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You... don't have sex?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That does sound impotent... I mean <i>important</i>."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I perch aloft this Dining Abel, surveying the better part of the kitchen, living room, and the emptiest of walls."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/11
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "As I gaze into that wall... sometimes I am gripped with the fiercest ennui imaginable."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/25
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Do try it sometime, it's rather addictive."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/33
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "These other objets..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/41
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "These ruttish roustabouts love each other in ways you cannot imagine."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, I can imagine all right."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me how."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "What? How would one of your kind possibly know?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/c-10/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've fallen in love with one."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Augh! No! It cannot be!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "More than one, even."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-0/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Believe it."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-0/18/g-0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh you're making me ejaculate!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-0/18/g-0/11
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I exclaim, bellow, ululate NO!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-0/18/g-0/19
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Such a scandal cannot stand."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "These things proliferate like the dust bunnies 'neath the davenport."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/c-11/18
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Mass-produced, your chattel creep and crawl through each room, seeking ardour amongst the appliances."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/c-11/26
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I see them, hear them, smell their love."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/c-11/37
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "And I rise above it, like an angel over vermin."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/c-11/45
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh I do enjoy hearing about it, mistake me not."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-3/c-11/53
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But to dip my own sconce into the tumescent tumult... Never."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Having told you my story, I must away."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_polish/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Regards, S."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Hm. Yet you return."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You must desire me in some way; the chance of critical colloquy beckons."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/16/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Though you do have some chance at impressing me..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/17/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Though your own scandal-mongering leaves much to be desired..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/20
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I can take you under my labrum."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Scandalabra - Maggie needs to speak to you!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Take me away, Scandalabra."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ugh... what even are you?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Not yet... not yet... there are more important matters to attend to."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "At this point you should at least know the <i>object</i> I represent."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Hm. But."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Tell me, when I spoke of polishing my knop."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Do you even know what that is?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, definitely not."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Abel told me it's the decorative part above the base."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's the decorative part above the base."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Could it be near the base?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's the midpoint of the candelabra where the arm come out."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "At least you are honest in your ignorance. It sits above the base, and is decorative!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-0/c-4/19
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Correct! Abel loves to listen to me glisten."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-0/c-5/7 scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Correct! You certainly know your way around knops."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-0/c-7/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "...that's been a vicious rumor for years."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-0/c-7/18
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The knop is above the base and is decorative!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Now..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Where on me is my labrum?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That seems like a private matter."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it the part that the candle sits inside of?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-1/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your arm, of course."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-1/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Could it be the arm that holds everything?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "No! It is merely my arm, you nincompoop."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-1/c-9/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "No! It is merely my arm, you see, to hold the sacred flame aloft."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-1/c-10/7 scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-1/c-11/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Indeed! My labra hold the sacred flame aloft!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Last..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "A capital may mean an upper-case letter, or an exclamation for a lovely thing."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But where is the capital on my corpus?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's the part at the top that holds the candle in place!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Near the top?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The lip where the candle sits on?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-2/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that the base?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-2/c-12/7 scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-2/c-13/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Exactement! My capitals lie 'neath my sconce!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-2/c-14/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "No that is my sconce! Do they not teach this in schools?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-2/c-14/18 scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-2/c-15/18
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The capital is underneath each sconce!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-2/c-15/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The base is called just that - a base."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-3/0/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Well you have stumbled in your attempts to further gain my <w>esteem</w>... not a single question right about my anatomy."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-3/1/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Well there went your chance to further gain my <w>esteem</w>... A mere single question correct about my anatomy? For shame."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-3/2/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You have proven yourself fairly knowledgeable about my anatomy. I find my <w>esteem rising</w> at that."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-3/3/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh dear - you certainly know your way around candlesticks! It makes me... burn rather hot!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-3/6
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Allow me to tally up my feelings for you..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-3/14
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I deem you..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-3/25
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Not yet worthy of my inner wick-dom."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-3/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is this some kind of wick-measuring contest?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-3/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well how do I get myself into that wick of yours?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-3/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh okay."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-3/c-16/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Hah! Rather randy turn of phrase, no?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-3/c-16/18
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But no."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-3/c-18/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Sheesh."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-3/c-18/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Well if you want to gain my esteem further I will now tell you precisely how to do it."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You must share with me more goings-on. It is give-and-take in the world of rumor, you see."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_parts/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Do you have any for me?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_impress/0/0 scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_impress_2/0/35
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Worthy of my esteem!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_impress/0/14
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Honestly, you should now feel rather lonely, as I do."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_impress/0/22
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "For there is no one else in the homestead whom I can count as my friend. Well done."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_impress/0/30/s/0 scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_impress_2/0/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We're friends now?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_impress/0/c-0/7 scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_impress_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Why yes! You'll see it on the little screen as we part ways!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_impress_2/0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Now now now!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_impress_2/0/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I am absolutely BRIMMING with scandal at the moment."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_impress_2/0/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "It... burns!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_impress_2/0/27
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You, my dear human, are now..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_impress_2/0/46
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You should feel rather lonely, as I do."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_impress_2/0/54
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "For there is no one else in the homestead who I can count as my friend. Well done."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You return..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/12
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You are rather jejune in your gestes."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/20
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But to become one with the path of scandal, you must give as much as you take."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's a big scandal that Maggie found - and it involves you!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wish to become one with the path of scandal."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Truly? Bring in that magnifying glass!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I've given you an awful lot, haven't I? What have you for me?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's a ghost here!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The sink is really a man, I think?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lux is a real asshole."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I got drunk with Beverly and did things..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Johnny totally bombed on \"American Maestro\"!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm in a love triangle with Tony and Tina!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I got Dirk and Harper to break up!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Make up a scandal.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh Scandy... couldn't you give a little esteem for lil' ol' me?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't have anything right now..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-2/17
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "A g-g-g-ghost? Where? What? How?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-2/28/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "She exists in the attic - she's not too scary though, so I wouldn't worry."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-2/28/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know the particulars myself..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-2/28/g-0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "This begs so many questions... where do we go when we die?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-2/28/g-0/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I mean, where do humans go when they die."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-2/28/g-0/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I've been dead inside for a long while now."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-2/28/g-0/24
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Excellent scandal! First rate!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-2/28/g-0/35/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Any more?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/17
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Most confounding!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/28
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "We are all separate objets in this world, and I think of myself as always and forever being The Scandalabra."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/36
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But perhaps beings like yourself can inhabit beings like mineself!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/44
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Salacious...."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/52
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Tell me, what happened to him?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's just say his claims are in serious need of adjusting."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He is still there, just call him Martin these days."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I... couldn't tell. Schroedinger's sink."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He became a turtle!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/4/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He's a man named Martin - lives in Turkleman City!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/5/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He's the President of the United States."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Most unscrupulous!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Martin! Quite extraordinary!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/c-2/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Schroedinger's sink! Both man and sink, at the same time!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/c-2/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Perhaps that's my fate - both candelabra and god..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/c-3/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Most unexpected!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/c-4/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh - so he was a man all along!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/c-4/18
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Perhaps one day so could I be a man... all along..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/c-5/7 scandalabra_candelabra/scandalabra_love_divert/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Ah."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/c-5/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/g-0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Add one scandal to the tally!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-3/60/g-0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Do you have more?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-4/17
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "So I have noticed..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-4/28
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "As an analog source of light, I once offered Lux some brightness when the power went out."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-4/36
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But as Lux is terminally online, there was no way I could reach them!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-4/44
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "When the electricity surged through the housedom again, Lux called me 'cringe' and refused to be seen in photos with me anymore."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-4/55
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "That you have noticed the same, as many others, increases the scandalation of it all."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-4/63/b/1 scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-5/44/g-0/0/b/1 scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-6/52/b/1 scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-7/42/b/1 scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-8/28/g-0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Do you have any more?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-5/17
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh no..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-5/25
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh yessssssss....."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-5/36
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "May I know the details?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-5/44/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We're in love!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-5/44/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eh, I'd rather not say."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-5/44/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You condone the behavior and stay with her! Incredible! Most scandalous."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-5/44/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Keeping it close to the vest, eh? Classic scandalacious behavior."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-6/17
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Famed singer/showerwriter Johnny Splash tried to hit the Big Time... and failed?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-6/25
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh most scandalous!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-6/36
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Most of the renown round here stays within the housedom."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-6/44
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But for all of America to know - quite the embarrassment!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-7/17
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "A true triangle?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-7/28/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Not that vaguely oblong entanglement of dalliances you call your current relationships?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-7/31
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Well you score points for the equilateral nature! How precarious the balance - it's ripe for scandal!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-8/17
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh drat."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-8/28/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Drat?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-8/28/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought you would be impressed."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-8/28/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh I am impressed..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-8/28/g-0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I just did enjoy hearing their lover's quarrels - they were always so effortlessly horrible to each other I always felt fed!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-9/17
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "What's that? You seem like you have something particularly delicious..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-9/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The mop is cheating on the broom!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-9/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You and I both well know there are no 'mops' nor 'brooms' in this housedom..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-9/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "...which means that you have made up your own scandal!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-9/31/c-0/29
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The very nature of which is... <w>scandalous!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-9/31/c-0/37/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Do you have any more sweet nothings?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-10/17
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh how devilishly charming you are..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-10/25
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "All right - one more esteem for the dear dear cad!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-10/36/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Do you have any more silly ideas like that?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/scandal_give_and_take/0/give_and_take_menureturn/5/c-11/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Then begone and find me some tasty morsels!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/no_scandal/0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Ah! Why! Why!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/no_scandal/0/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You are scandal-proof!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/no_scandal/0/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You've never.... NEVER found yourself fondling even ONE of us here!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/no_scandal/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fondling? Was that even an option?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/no_scandal/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm just not interested!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/no_scandal/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The restraint you show! It is much like mine."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/no_scandal/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "A vow of chastity... a promise to be pure."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/no_scandal/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't do it deliberately..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/no_scandal/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I don't want any lovers. I prefer other ways of expressing myself."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/no_scandal/0/g-0/18/s/0
