msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "That safe has scandalized me for so long with her kinky iniquity - and now she has made you her paramour as well? Scandal upon scandal!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/272/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You've served up a hot bowl of love with the stove. I would blow on it to make it cool you down but then my very flames would go out!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/275/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You walk up and down these stairs all day long - and still she loves you? I cannot imagine the indignity."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/278/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "If I could give an <i>award</i> for the number of lovers you have, it would be Far Too Many: First Prize!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/281/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The television has fallen for your charms as well? Surely there's something better on!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/284/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The very display of words has fallen in love with you! This must be a typo!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/287/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You childhood teddy has grown up to become your lover. I would feel so cuddly if you weren't entangled with so many others at the same time!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/290/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You and the clock have quite the courtship - but your time will be up!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/293/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You and the musical triangle have dinged, donged, and flung yourselves into a fling!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/296/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You've allowed the tools to screw themselves down into your heart! There's no fixing that."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/299/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "And you became a treacherous triplicate of tramps!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/302/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Soap - bubbles - scandals fly! You and the pods have dissolved into a loving embrace!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/305/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The cotton sings of scandal - you and the towel have stained each other with loving..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/308/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "It's a trap! The two of you have loved each other as vermin do - secretly and underground!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/311/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Cracks appear in my own form as I find out you've wantonly wooed the wall!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/314/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You have done wicked things with the washing machine. No amount of detergent can cleanse this iniquity!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/317/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Why... both of these wardrobe-washing acrobats have stooped so low to let you onto their stage!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/320/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You have made it work out - with work itself? This is egregious and repetitive to say!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/323/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "It's getting steamy - your relationship with the water heater overboils my propriety!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/326/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You're so transparent - you can't hide that you've cavorted with the windows!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/329/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Darkness surrounds me as I find out that you've fallen in love with the lord of shadows himself!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/332/b/4
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You've gotten yourself entangled with a ghostly phantom - I'm spooked!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/exhortation_begin/0/g-0/8/335/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "And you know the greatest scandal of them all - my true identity!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_1/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "So few scandals. It is, unfortunate."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_1/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I simply must ask you to go back out there and do your dirtiest!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_2/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Now, I'm not very good at counting."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_2/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But that's somewhere over 25 scandals at least!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_2/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Is it getting hot in here, or are those my flames burning just a mite more fiercely?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_2/24
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Hoo hoo!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_3/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Why, that's over half the objets here!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_3/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Some people think of a scandalous house being half empty..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_3/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I think of it as half full of bawdy beings!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_4/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "This is getting rather serious."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_4/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Most of the house is in love with thee."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_4/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "These numbers of loves are unprecedented."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_4/24
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "And yet you still come back to little old me?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_4/35
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Don't forget me when you've screwed the whole house, all right?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_5/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I. Am. Gobsmacked."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_5/11
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "That's practically the entirety of this housedom. In love with thineself."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_5/19
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "How... How... How...."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_5/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Scandalabra's breath is beginning to quicken, his cheeks flushing."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_5/35
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "<w>THE SCANDAL... IT IS TOO MUCH!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_5/46
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He staggers forward, bracing himself against the wall with one hand as the sheer weight of all your scandal surges through him."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_5/54
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I CANNOT KEEP IT IN!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_5/65
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Scandalabra trembles, his fingers digging into the drywall as he can no longer contain himself."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_5/76
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "AUGH!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/love_end_5/101
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Forgive me for my... final ejaculation."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/spicy_scandal/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Scandalabra gives you a look that sends a shiver down your spine—is it desire? Or fear?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/spicy_scandal/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh you NAUGHTY thing you."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/spicy_scandal/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "We are approaching maximum levels of scandal here."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/spicy_scandal/24
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "And I am running out of breath!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/spicy_scandal/32
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "My pulse quickens, my unmentionables tighten..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/spicy_scandal/40
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I must needs love you before you run out of room for more!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/hot_scandal/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "My my my my my!!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/hot_scandal/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh over 70 lovers? A wizard, a true star!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/hot_scandal/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "In my own research on scandal while tucked away in the drawing room of a lord in Calais, I have heard tell that there were humans who loved in such high numbers."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/hot_scandal/24
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But never would I have thought a commoner such as yourself could pull it off!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/medium_scandal/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh dear oh dear oh dear...."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/medium_scandal/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "This is more than fifty lovers?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/medium_scandal/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "This should not be possible... yet here is the 'dex itself!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/enough_scandal/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "This amount of lovers... is quite sufficient for my desires."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/enough_scandal/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh yes, quite sufficient..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/enough_scandal/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The amount of scandal fills me with energy!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/low_scandal/0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "This low amount of lovers... it is not quite enough to pique my interest."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/low_scandal/0/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "If you were to say, make it a menage a many..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/low_scandal/0/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Then I might be swayed to think of you a little differently."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/low_scandal/0/24
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "A little more... lasciviously..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/low_scandal/0/32
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "If you desire it... of course."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/low_scandal/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm okay, thanks."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/low_scandal/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll do my best."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/low_scandal/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "As above, so blow me."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/low_scandal/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "We go no further."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/low_scandal/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Hmmhmmmhmmhmmhmmmmm... hm."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/low_scandal/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "...I eagerly await."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/9
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I cannot contain this passion in mere dialogue."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/17
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "The greatest scandal of all - for a human to love, really love one of us objets."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/25
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You must, absolutely must, kiss me, my dear."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/33
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Not here - within the bounds of dialogue and narrator..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/41
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But outside... in the dining room itself. Lips to metal."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/49
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "It would be so wrong... yet so devilishly right."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No way I'm doing that."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay, sure."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love to! You're kinda cute..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/60/s/0 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This seems like what you need is something else."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Well then there is no further need to elaborate on our relationship."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Come to me when you are ready to experience true bliss."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Kind of... cute?!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "<w>I SAY</w>"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/c-4/18 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/c-3/18 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_success/0/c-4/18 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_nokiss/0/c-2/18 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_2/0/g-0/c-5/18 scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_return_3_nokiss/0/c-2/18
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Maybe... this waits..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Well and this is very very good indeed."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "When we finish talking, you must place your lips longingly and gently 'pon mine silver."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Then apply a slight... suction..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh and then... and then!!!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "...I'll see you on the other side..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I once thought that I could trust you. That I could tell you all my secret desires, and you would reciprocate with romance."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/16
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But you spurn and shame me."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/24
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I must be kissed if you want this liaison to progress any further."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't want to kiss you."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All right, I'll give you a little peck."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Then begone!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "A large, long, languorous kiss."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/c-1/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course, I'll do all those things in the overworld... I mean, my home."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/c-1/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No way."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/kiss_quest_nokiss/0/c-1/18/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I desire it and it shall be so!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Uh... why..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Why are you looking at me like that?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come now, Scandalabra. You can talk to me."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's because I care about you."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I... I..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But... I'm outrageous!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Nobody ever takes me seriously."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I mean... how could you?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem like someone who is hiding something..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem like you are addicted to something..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "What would I possibly have to hide beneath my wicks?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Scandal... yes... but nothing more..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You want to feel important."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You want to be deeply loved yourself."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You cover a dark secret with this put-on personality."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I... do."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I'm a mere candle-holder, an affectation of an era long gone."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-4/23
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Lux with their modern socketry dances around me like a malignant sprite... and the sun will always shine greater than I."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Yes... that's true."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I'm... jealous of the dalliances of the others. I wish that they would turn their attentions on me."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-5/23
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "But no one does..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-5/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It might be because you are too loud."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-5/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It might be because they are afraid of you."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-5/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I say..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-5/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "That... might just be the ticket."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-5/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Why would they be?"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-5/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Oh why would they of COURSE they would. I follow their every move!"
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-5/31/g-0/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You've listened to me and spoken as an equal."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I do. Indeed I do."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-6/18/b/1
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "You know it all too well."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I cannot tell you my secret though. I simply cannot."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-6/29
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Perhaps one day... if you show me enough affection..."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-6/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't need to tell me."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-6/37/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll do anything to gain that knowledge."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-6/37/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "One day, perhaps."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-6/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "What a relief."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-6/37/c-1/7
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "Dear me... I suppose it'll have to do."
msgstr ""

#: scandalabra_candelabra/empathy_investigation/0/g-1/c-6/37/g-0/8
msgctxt "Scandalabra"
msgid "I do try to distract with my silly displays."
